The Hilbert-curve order follows D. Hilbert (1891); the check digit is H. M. Damm's
algorithm (2004). Spot codes are N-Ways' own 10 m grid over each commune's frame; the
cards also show the gate's Plus Code (Open Location Code, Apache 2.0 specification by
Google). The national outline and the area seeds are derived from OpenStreetMap
(© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) and GeoNames (CC BY 4.0).
